      "structure_description": "The discrete {P4W42Ce6} polyoxoanion combines two {W11} and two {P(III)W8} building blocks with a tartronic-acid-decorated {W4Ce6P2} heterometallic cluster. The article also describes it as two centrosymmetrically related {P(III)W19Ce} moieties linked through the central cluster.",
